# RoamVantage — Auth

- Clients: `src/lib/supabase/{client,server,middleware}.ts` (`@supabase/ssr`)
- Actions: `src/lib/auth/actions.ts` — `signUp` / `signIn` / `signOut` (email+password; Google deferred)
- Callback: `/auth/callback` exchanges `code` for session
- Middleware: refreshes session; protects `/dashboard` and `/tours/*`; redirects authed users away from `/login` `/signup`; `/t/*` stays public
- Profile row: DB trigger `handle_new_user` on `auth.users` (reads `raw_user_meta_data.name`)
- Local: confirmations off in `supabase/config.toml` — signup returns a session immediately
- Errors: redirect with `?error=` + `AuthError` component

Do not add `export const runtime = "edge"`.
